{"id": "airport-bond-trustee-retroactive-approval", "title": "Board ratified an Airport bond-trustee agreement after 30 years", "seconds": 50.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "353d2e06d48b1401", "words": 153, "beats": [{"scene": "contract", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "Why did the Board revisit an Airport agreement after 30 years?", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.86, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["A", "trustee", "agreement", "returns"], "sub": "San Francisco Airport Commission"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.42, 0.52, 0.79, 1.35, 1.46, 1.81, 2.24, 2.5, 2.77]}, {"scene": "contract", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "The Airport selected its bond trustee through competition in 1991.", "t0": 3.86, "t1": 7.72, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Airport bond trustee", "heading": "Selection and original agreement", "source": "original", "rows": [{"icon": "calendar", "label": "Competitive selection", "value": "1991"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Agreement signed", "value": "1992"}]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.23, 0.67, 1.12, 1.27, 1.5, 1.94, 2.19, 2.83, 2.95, 3.29]}, {"scene": "contract", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "It signed the agreement in 1992. The original authorization was $260,000.", "t0": 7.84, "t1": 13.4, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$260,000", "label": "Initial authorization"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.36, 0.47, 0.91, 1.04, 1.39, 2.43, 2.59, 2.95, 3.66, 3.84, 4.1, 4.43, 4.76, 5.08]}, {"scene": "term", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[1]", "suspicious[0]"], "text": "The contract lasted as long as the master bond resolution.", "t0": 13.62, "t1": 16.33, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "bla", "heading": "Duration", "context": "The contract term", "layout": "relationship", "rows": [{"icon": "document", "label": "Master bond resolution", "value": "No fixed end date"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.59, 0.99, 1.11, 1.32, 1.41, 1.52, 1.86, 2.08]}, {"scene": "term", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "That term exceeded the Charter’s 10-year threshold for Board approval.", "t0": 16.45, "t1": 19.42, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "bla", "heading": "Charter review", "context": "The contract term", "layout": "relationship", "rows": [{"icon": "calendar", "label": "Duration threshold", "value": "10 years"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.49, 0.86, 0.97, 1.35, 1.69, 2.12, 2.27, 2.47]}, {"scene": "term", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "Airport staff pointed to the Commission’s separate authority over bonds.", "t0": 19.54, "t1": 22.96, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "bla", "heading": "Agency explanation", "context": "The contract term", "layout": "relationship", "rows": [{"icon": "document", "label": "Bond functions", "value": "Airport Commission"}, {"icon": "document", "label": "Review", "value": "City Attorney"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.78, 1.13, 1.25, 1.35, 1.86, 2.23, 2.71, 2.93]}, {"scene": "term", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "The City Attorney advised seeking approval to resolve the uncertainty.", "t0": 23.08, "t1": 26.1, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "bla", "heading": "City Attorney’s advice", "context": "The contract term", "layout": "relationship", "rows": [{"icon": "document", "label": "Review", "value": "Board approval"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.36, 0.72, 1.12, 1.41, 1.79, 1.92, 2.27, 2.38]}, {"scene": "vote", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "In March 2022 the Board ratified the original agreement and five modifications.", "t0": 26.32, "t1": 30.8, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "vote", "heading": "Resolution 81-22", "context": "The Board vote", "layout": "relationship", "rows": [{"icon": "calendar", "label": "Vote", "value": "March 8, 2022"}, {"icon": "document", "label": "Prior modifications", "value": "5"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.45, 0.71, 1.38, 1.53, 1.77, 2.25, 2.35, 2.69, 3.15, 3.29, 3.54]}, {"scene": "vote", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "A sixth modification added $1,050,000 to the ceiling.", "t0": 30.92, "t1": 34.56, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "amend", "heading": "New authority", "context": "The Board vote", "layout": "amounts", "rows": [{"icon": "receipt", "label": "Modification 6", "value": "$1,050,000"}, {"icon": "receipt", "label": "Total ceiling", "value": "$3,800,000"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.38, 1.18, 1.46, 1.68, 1.87, 2.17, 2.36, 2.64, 2.96, 3.08, 3.18]}, {"scene": "fees", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "By December 2021 the Airport had paid about $2.7 million in trustee fees.", "t0": 34.78, "t1": 39.83, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "bla", "heading": "Actual fees", "context": "Fees and authorization", "layout": "amounts", "rows": [{"icon": "receipt", "label": "Fees paid", "value": "$2.7 million"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.51, 0.77, 1.54, 1.69, 2.1, 2.22, 2.43, 2.64, 2.86, 3.11, 3.4, 3.72, 4.1, 4.19, 4.6]}, {"scene": "fees", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "Annual fees at the time were around $146,000.", "t0": 39.95, "t1": 43.53, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "bla", "heading": "Annual fee estimate", "context": "Fees and authorization", "layout": "amounts", "rows": [{"icon": "receipt", "label": "Annual fees", "value": "$146,000"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.75, 0.85, 0.97, 1.27, 1.46, 1.77, 1.93, 2.22, 2.73, 3.06]}, {"scene": "fees", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished", "next"], "text": "The documents identify a delayed approval. They establish no improper fee.", "t0": 43.65, "t1": 47.53, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Later amendments", "Board approval"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.57, 1.09, 1.16, 1.45, 2.29, 2.49, 2.97, 3.16, 3.59]}, {"scene": "fees", "kind": "end", "ref": ["sources"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 47.65, "t1": 49.8, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"contract": "The original award", "term": "The contract term", "vote": "The Board vote", "fees": "Fees and authorization"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "question"}